.env*.local

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo

example

# generated native folders
/ios
/android
.env

# Firebase. The service account key is a private key with admin rights on the project and
# must never be committed — it belongs in EAS credentials, not in the repo. google-services.json
# is not secret in the same way (it ships inside the APK) but is per-project config, so it is
# supplied at build time rather than tracked here.
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist
